## Implementation Approach
1. Initialize per-tenant state and buffers when `beginTenant` is called
2. Route incoming messages to appropriate tenant join windows
3. Join 'orders' and 'payments' streams within 20-second windows
4. Emit reconciled results to 'tenant_reconciliations' topic
5. Track offsets per-tenant and commit independently
6. Implement error handling to isolate tenant failures
7. Include canary test with 3 messages to validate multi-tenant flow

